      "text": "ORDERS\n----------------------------------\nid               UNIQUEIDENTIFIER PK\nuser_id          FK > users  NN\nstore_id         FK > store  NULL SET NULL\ndriver_id        FK > driver  NULL\n-- snapshots (copied at checkout) --\nstore_name       NVARCHAR  NN\naddress_name     NVARCHAR  NN\ncity             NVARCHAR  NN\narea             NVARCHAR  NN\nstreet           NVARCHAR  NN\nbuilding_number  NVARCHAR  NN\nfloor            INT  NN\naddress_note     NVARCHAR  NULL\nlatitude         DECIMAL(9,6)  NN\nlongitude        DECIMAL(9,6)  NN\ndelivery_fee     DECIMAL(10,3)  NN\ntotal            DECIMAL(10,3)  NN\n-- order --\nnote             NVARCHAR  NULL\npayment_method   CHECK(cash/card)  NN\nstatus           CHECK(6 statuses)  NN\naccepted_at      DATETIME2  NULL\non_the_way_at    DATETIME2  NULL\ndelivered_at     DATETIME2  NULL\ndeclined_at      DATETIME2  NULL\ncancelled_at     DATETIME2  NULL\ncancellation_reason  NVARCHAR  NULL\ncreated_at       DATETIME2\nupdated_at       DATETIME2\nCHECK(reason iff declined/cancelled)",
      "originalText": "ORDERS\n----------------------------------\nid               UNIQUEIDENTIFIER PK\nuser_id          FK > users  NN\nstore_id         FK > store  NULL SET NULL\ndriver_id        FK > driver  NULL\n-- snapshots (copied at checkout) --\nstore_name       NVARCHAR  NN\naddress_name     NVARCHAR  NN\ncity             NVARCHAR  NN\narea             NVARCHAR  NN\nstreet           NVARCHAR  NN\nbuilding_number  NVARCHAR  NN\nfloor            INT  NN\naddress_note     NVARCHAR  NULL\nlatitude         DECIMAL(9,6)  NN\nlongitude        DECIMAL(9,6)  NN\ndelivery_fee     DECIMAL(10,3)  NN\ntotal            DECIMAL(10,3)  NN\n-- order --\nnote             NVARCHAR  NULL\npayment_method   CHECK(cash/card)  NN\nstatus           CHECK(6 statuses)  NN\naccepted_at      DATETIME2  NULL\non_the_way_at    DATETIME2  NULL\ndelivered_at     DATETIME2  NULL\ndeclined_at      DATETIME2  NULL\ncancelled_at     DATETIME2  NULL\ncancellation_reason  NVARCHAR  NULL\ncreated_at       DATETIME2\nupdated_at       DATETIME2\nCHECK(reason iff declined/cancelled)",
